[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6124.03, "timestamp": "01:42:04", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6126.229, "timestamp": "01:42:06", "text": "嗯，你总是那么阳光健康。你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6128.629, "timestamp": "01:42:08", "text": "总是很好，但那里的创伤太严重了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6137.99, "timestamp": "01:42:17", "text": "真的。所以，我没做的事情是给予"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6144.03, "timestamp": "01:42:24", "text": "或许是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6146.83, "timestamp": "01:42:26", "text": "永远像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6152.35, "timestamp": "01:42:32", "text": "打喷嚏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6163.03, "timestamp": "01:42:43", "text": "为什么三个人要交换引擎盖？好的，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6173.149, "timestamp": "01:42:53", "text": "我注意到的一件事是，我从未去过"}]